\label{lemma-avramov}
Let $A \to B$ be a flat local homomorphism of Noetherian local rings.
Then the following are equivalent
\begin{enumerate}
\item $B$ is a complete intersection,
\item $A$ and $B/\mathfrak m_A B$ are complete intersections.
\end{enumerate}

